            <div xml:id="m-ebbc3b51-da28-47b5-b646-ce8e9cdf2c7d">
              <lg xml:id="m-eab92b14-fae3-434e-8dea-a2c0c3d219f3">
                <l xml:id="m-aff7057e-d82d-4e12-b55a-c365a1c0ec09" facs="#m-80dbc81f-42ed-4c47-be3a-a6aaa9492817" label="ambiguous">241</l><l xml:id="m-8fef9c67-9224-4ce3-962d-2175309b0d70" facs="#m-f1f0e2c9-b30c-443d-98fb-766728294457" label="text-like">Sunday at Sext.</l><l xml:id="m-1f664996-9461-4738-ac10-a5d6188e63fd" facs="#m-e2e05711-d60f-4b5d-9f91-fdd6652e6fbc" label="text-like">2. On Solemn Feasts.</l><l xml:id="m-8ca39ba3-bfc9-4aaa-8882-6c7333ce1a6c" facs="#m-656d02b5-cabd-49b4-9c62-e840b834634c" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-bfc6cef6-0acf-41b9-b84a-25da96e06d36" facs="#m-d9bd3acf-43d5-4319-bd1f-0e5dbab3a38f" label="ambiguous">R</l><l xml:id="m-7d29e452-c433-4611-8793-671baceed5a9" facs="#m-fb2b2d08-2350-4e9b-be12-c2f27ebab8c4" label="lyrics-like">Ector pót-ens, vé-rax Dé-us, Qui témperas ré-rum</l><l xml:id="m-21bcf8c5-fbf1-494b-9126-b2949d4a3a18" facs="#m-d62e2392-5566-426c-b449-2c2e403e8a28" label="lyrics-like">ví-ces, Splendóre mane illúmi-nas,</l><l xml:id="m-4c4f887c-3266-4836-8268-c28cbf62dcc9" facs="#m-e3a9b7ae-7646-41ee-8868-b0f59253df36" label="lyrics-like">Et ígni-bus me-rí¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ab3cb76-1746-4dc6-830d-24ced5e08af0" facs="#m-29155fba-d160-4c28-b29e-695c927f43d2" label="ambiguous">di- em:</l><l xml:id="m-21663f3f-c356-4dd8-ae5c-6254fa3be718" facs="#m-315ddf18-70e4-4181-9c93-107389d992da" label="lyrics-like">Praésta, Päter piissime,</l><l xml:id="m-88a86207-296c-4bcc-ba57-efcfa0ca9009" facs="#m-b746f716-6715-4141-bd8e-50397f4c4768" label="lyrics-like">Exstingue flámmas litium,</l><l xml:id="m-76dfcefb-c9d9-449f-9b40-172f2e7ec67a" facs="#m-73e383ea-8fe1-413a-8b0a-17a61df78fa0" label="lyrics-like">Aufer calórem nóxium,</l><l xml:id="m-befc036f-006a-4640-a00c-3e53c6dd6178" facs="#m-9170db94-cbda-4b6d-8238-053b9d45e7bb" label="lyrics-like">Patrique cómpar Unice,</l><l xml:id="m-ec2b7a46-7fcd-4816-8119-ab143221ffa1" facs="#m-803109a8-189f-476a-8082-c636aee646f6" label="lyrics-like">Cum Spiritu Paráclito,</l><l xml:id="m-0581eede-8b22-42be-8abf-f34a3720b0be" facs="#m-6885a7c2-3256-4c0b-8689-7f793c90af8b" label="lyrics-like">Cónfer salútem córporum,</l><l xml:id="m-6fd94351-2b92-4e3e-aa34-f3b28f22e97f" facs="#m-aa6bae08-2a5d-441f-95ca-a72a8a544cdb" label="lyrics-like">Verámque pâcem córdium.</l><l xml:id="m-57cb9534-76fc-4d45-afaa-0264562f5bbb" facs="#m-9f9fb735-4729-409d-882b-7f2fc574a8c3" label="lyrics-like">Régnans per ómne saéculum.</l><l xml:id="m-65ae4b3d-edc0-49f4-abbc-5b2eeb1b2201" facs="#m-6434f226-3e35-40d6-93f1-ac79a23bb222" label="ambiguous">Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-52777dc3-ac8a-40f5-9c17-9ddd7cfb66f5" facs="#m-bde47faf-23bd-47be-8cd1-2ea7587e9ca9" label="text-like">During the Year.</l><l xml:id="m-76d6a606-2b48-478c-90de-d5d07166610f" facs="#m-ce0d9ff3-a951-4270-98d0-cd40429f053f" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-34c8f860-1530-4806-9db7-617837598ce2" facs="#m-91acd79a-8d5c-4601-8e96-94899df76b9a" label="ambiguous">s.d</l><l xml:id="m-6fe838c2-0df5-4ad7-837e-752285e02c42" facs="#m-23d2b8d5-073e-4b20-a5bf-7fdf1d00ea72" label="lyrics-like">Lle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-4cf5184e-3523-433a-bcce-b8342a524417" facs="#m-0e178cc6-62d7-49e7-8671-f55bd016ce1b" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-5140997d-10ee-48ba-bd94-ed48fbc31eb4" facs="#m-57699e4d-ca0f-4254-9367-ee23d4a4718f" label="text-like">In Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-1ce927f4-0366-40c2-a832-2838c08f26e8" facs="#m-326b8bc6-ade4-43f5-aab0-d80e26de6fb7" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-fbf316b4-3163-4348-a642-96b2facdca85" facs="#m-60de4930-2bb1-4ee8-8436-1525315451f3" label="ambiguous">s. e</l><l xml:id="m-9315a7c2-ef28-4073-9d32-0728813e3c1b" facs="#m-5f6a8db7-7035-446f-bff3-eccceca1eebc" label="lyrics-like">HLe-ĺ-ia</l><l xml:id="m-8d9f4d9d-f5d5-476c-a9e2-bbf4ca7c5625" facs="#m-d49d8b68-5696-4bc4-a5f7-1f57707f0506" label="ambiguous">E u o u a e.</l><l xml:id="m-f470d9df-fa39-4285-b98f-4ce92ee76119" facs="#m-e0078880-cc3d-44d5-b3df-8670811c490f" label="text-like">During Advent, Septuagesima, and Lent, the Antiphon is taken from the</l><l xml:id="m-f4f580b0-fde8-4ad0-af0f-7a44cd37a6f8" facs="#m-1bcc3872-02b4-4e0b-95ab-53876e7b90f9" label="text-like">Proper of the Time, and on Feast days, from the Proper of the Feast.</l><l xml:id="m-813025a9-e89e-4c8a-86ad-5c08935d573a" facs="#m-6fadce70-c3ba-4249-9555-601a2c79b069" label="lyrics-like">Narravérunt mihi iniqui fabula¬</l><l xml:id="m-abe4d331-72a7-42be-8f3c-a990d4c62ffe" facs="#m-cda17158-8633-466c-bb8e-978b5b7664c4" label="ambiguous">Psalm 118. VI.</l><l xml:id="m-ec037a6e-06cf-4913-bbe8-6bee675a0a59" facs="#m-1cce4b69-43cf-4298-b684-8c0696b47a3b" label="lyrics-like">Efécit in salutáre túum ánima tiónes:" sed non ut lex túa.</l><l xml:id="m-0ae9e8cb-edc2-4bee-901d-4ee2ed089777" facs="#m-290e7a6c-f88d-4f02-9194-79451de6966f" label="lyrics-like">Omnia mandáta túa veritas:"</l><l xml:id="m-9115236d-6801-4f0f-84e6-d9f2094919ff" facs="#m-516df851-44a1-458b-a5c8-ac7b219a12df" label="lyrics-like">O méa:* et in vérbum túum su¬</l><l xml:id="m-1b4cde39-3f42-4648-aebe-8e26a8a5c338" facs="#m-9d47a688-e411-4562-a211-9283396c00ae" label="lyrics-like">inique persecúti sunt me, ádjuva</l><l xml:id="m-f2475345-6dcd-412d-8a62-272f8a49cfab" facs="#m-003721a5-5c1f-498c-851c-7653b5c907d2" label="lyrics-like">persperávi.</l><l xml:id="m-9ba3a248-932e-4481-bc65-250c26618e9f" facs="#m-75c8ef71-6565-420d-b2b9-8cfae39065e9" label="lyrics-like">Defecérunt óculi méi in elóquium</l><l xml:id="m-a324367e-8a61-42c4-9505-abdfdf44b500" facs="#m-2196586e-3c2c-4a2c-8346-009c05fd6b18" label="ambiguous">me.</l><l xml:id="m-32dfeaa0-5a3a-49bf-a549-2912beb07755" facs="#m-1929eb04-86ee-495b-bef1-ad49ce6c92ae" label="lyrics-like">Paulo minus consummavérunt</l><l xml:id="m-2c6c0dbf-ff71-438d-898d-70c80a9c65d5" facs="#m-38cc2541-5509-4139-b8ce-77db7864d14c" label="lyrics-like">túum, “dicéntes: Quando conso¬</l><l xml:id="m-a06784e5-27af-4f03-b8c2-2cf7560fd963" facs="#m-0f54760c-683e-4793-8890-3c5dc45021d7" label="lyrics-like">mé in térra: “égo autem non de¬</l><l xml:id="m-f7abcdcd-5665-4745-964e-ab01028711c4" facs="#m-760a73aa-125c-4598-afb3-12f40ae8728d" label="lyrics-like">láberis me?</l><l xml:id="m-535bb8b9-9c34-4906-9cee-32d5b9775fa6" facs="#m-0a79f68f-9bee-42c3-8527-aaded9259a39" label="lyrics-like">reliqui mandáta túa.</l><l xml:id="m-d058dafb-3424-48c9-9f98-809f4a45c54d" facs="#m-a4cc19ac-071b-472a-8b17-d057b42a3012" label="lyrics-like">Quia fáctus sum sicut úter in</l><l xml:id="m-bfb14f84-cd3a-4102-a523-1b69abd3b04a" facs="#m-40f59d1b-0520-4184-a33d-3c2b8c4e738f" label="lyrics-like">Secúndum misericórdiam túam</l><l xml:id="m-bbe98456-b881-444a-b287-8d44c5510dc8" facs="#m-22c5b829-3cf3-49b6-af93-fad7259623be" label="lyrics-like">pruína:*justificatiónes túas non</l><l xml:id="m-3fb40314-243b-47e8-96d4-690eac1c1266" facs="#m-dffae76b-cfb8-4d59-9f4f-c737c25665cd" label="lyrics-like">súm oblitus.</l><l xml:id="m-7200d893-0660-4d4f-9b8a-239ec7e79a18" facs="#m-ba2f7e63-a90c-4232-99ab-a4df3b9770da" label="lyrics-like">vivifica me: * et custódiam testi¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb09a480-abeb-465c-8b2d-668096c513da" facs="#m-31b5413c-8f91-4d9d-b9bb-ef4614da39b0" label="lyrics-like">Quot sunt dies sérvi túi? * quan¬</l><l xml:id="m-77c63bf7-6234-4cec-9dcf-30b25776a169" facs="#m-23562edf-58fb-4dbc-ab23-f2db660a0413" label="lyrics-like">mónia óris túi.</l><l xml:id="m-684d1458-77d1-4b7e-a14b-d6d18baa3bc1" facs="#m-71980bf4-51c3-4f4b-8c1b-82da6c5fe6fa" label="lyrics-like">In aetérnum, Dómine, * vérbum</l><l xml:id="m-25d43df5-f0d5-476d-a3b4-a1bd2df0a28e" facs="#m-df33f249-2339-4651-abbb-dc23f5daf148" label="lyrics-like">do fácies de persequéntibus mé</l><l xml:id="m-42bdd478-5512-4bd6-93bf-d47630a545cf" facs="#m-5da84b11-2d85-4992-a0b1-bc7ab5ef67f6" label="lyrics-like">l túum pérmanet in caélo.</l><l xml:id="m-549cda5e-0c9f-4111-a6a2-aa2a351fddad" facs="#m-e5bd85dd-bbe1-4137-8052-c4d9a20b2285" label="ambiguous">judicium?</l><l xml:id="m-8321e723-ef1f-4ebc-aadc-f08b9de5f9ab" facs="#m-cc8a3694-0154-4d4e-9a8c-2307a4898560" label="ambiguous">Ne sol. — 12</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
